<title>POLAND: FORTE NOV NET RISES TO PLN 3.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>FORTE NOV NET RISES TO PLN 3.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.63 vs   2.36</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.09 vs   2.36</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.88 vs   2.77</p>
<p> Sales		   31.38 vs  23.42</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    21.14 vs   8.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	21.63 vs   8.31</p>
<p> Operating profit    24.15 vs  18.15</p>
<p> Sales		  253.92 vs 202.70</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish furniture maker is Fabryka Mebli</p>
<p>Forte SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
